    "description": "Orgain is the budget alternative for people who mainly want plant protein. Per the label at the time of writing, two scoops of about 46 g give 21 g of protein from organic pea, brown rice and chia seed, at roughly 150 calories, sweetened with organic erythritol and stevia. It is easy to find in warehouse clubs and online, and its cost per 25 g of protein is a fraction of Happy Viking's. It is a protein powder rather than a meal, so add your own fruit and fat.",
